# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [1.0.3] - 2026-08-06

### Added
- Created official repository Wiki containing high-level architecture diagrams, usage guides, and API specs.
- Added comprehensive `Home.md`, `Quick-Start.md`, `Architecture.md`, `API-Reference.md`, and `Roadmap.md` wiki files.
- Added project roadmap detailing planned milestones for Q3/Q4 2026 (automatic retries, dataset streaming, webhook helpers).

### Documentation
- Expanded TypeScript usage examples with strict error handling and clean code practices.
- Documented internal Facade pattern implementation and SOLID design choices.

---

## [1.0.2] - 2026-08-01

### Fixed
- Fixed URL encoding issue on query parameters containing special characters.
- Resolved type inference issue when passing optional `memoryMbytes` options.

---

## [1.0.1] - 2026-07-28

### Changed
- Improved error messaging when `APIFY_TOKEN` is missing or invalid.
- Refactored core config normalization parser for faster execution.

---

## [1.0.0] - 2026-07-25

### Added
- Initial release of `apify-manager` as a zero-dependency, portable source bundle.
- Core URL builder module `buildApiUrl` supporting `:id` path placeholders and query merging.
- Server-side typed fetch abstraction `fetchApi` for Node.js, Deno, Astro, and Bun.
- React integration hook `useApiUrl` using `useMemo` for performance optimization.
- Self-healing configuration parser to trim whitespace and fix copy-paste errors in `apis.json`.